				<wikidot:authorName>DarkStuff</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1581620</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ah shit meant to be more speedy about my comment and instead just left this tab open. Whoops! Anyhow, creepy crawly dog from <em>The Thing</em> we have here. I like it! It honestly seems like a Euclid anomaly that Wilson's just didn't know enough about. I like that we have a zombie dog, I like that it wasn't <em>just</em> a zombie dog (I was fully prepared for it to follow all the normal tropes of &quot;zombie&quot; when I started reading but it became different and better than that), I think (though this may be skewed due to my reading of a previous draft) that it's not hard to figure out what happened before the ending reveals its hand to you, but that doesn't greatly diminish my enjoyment. Also, didn't realize this Daniel character had appeared before. Neat as heck!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
